<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }
    .header { background-color: #dc2626; color: white; padding: 20px; }
    .content { padding: 20px; }
    .details { background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 15px 0; }
    .details dt { font-weight: bold; color: #374151; }
    .details dd { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    code { background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-family: monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Phishing Report</h1>
    <p>Automated abuse report from phish.directory</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <p>Dear Abuse Team,</p>

    <p>We have detected a phishing site hosted on your infrastructure. We kindly request that you investigate and take appropriate action.</p>

    <div class="details">
      <dl>
        <dt>Domain:</dt>
        <dd><code><%= @payload[:domain] || @case.domain_name || "Unknown" %></code></dd>

        <% if @payload[:url].present? %>
          <dt>Full URL:</dt>
          <dd><code><%= @payload[:url] %></code></dd>
        <% end %>

        <dt>Classification:</dt>
        <dd><%= @payload[:classification]&.titleize || "Phishing" %></dd>

        <dt>Confidence:</dt>
        <dd><%= @payload[:confidence].present? ? "#{(@payload[:confidence].to_f * 100).round(1)}%" : "High" %></dd>

        <dt>Detected At:</dt>
        <dd><%= @payload[:detected_at] || @case.created_at&.iso8601 || Time.current.iso8601 %></dd>

        <dt>Case Reference:</dt>
        <dd><code><%= @payload[:case_reference] || @case.case_number %></code></dd>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <% if @payload[:sources].present? %>
      <h3>Detection Sources</h3>
      <p>This site was flagged by the following security services:</p>
      <ul>
        <% @payload[:sources].each do |source| %>
          <li><%= source[:service] || source['service'] %></li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
    <% end %>

    <p>
      Please reply to this email with any updates regarding your investigation.
      Include the case reference <code><%= @payload[:case_reference] %></code> in your response.
    </p>

    <p>
      Thank you for your cooperation in keeping the internet safe.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>
      This is an automated report from <a href="https://phish.directory">phish.directory</a>.
      For questions, contact us at <%= @payload[:reporter_email] %>.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Case Reference:</strong> <%= @payload[:case_reference] %>
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
